        "width": 2200,
        "height": 1465
      }
    ],
    "description": "60*50\nOil on canvas\n\nI began this painting at the end of July with a charcoal sketch and then left it for a long time cause I didn’t know which fixative to choose.\nIn the end I just used my hairspray when I couldn’t find a better alternative ._. After that I covered it with imprimatura of yellow ochre and continued painting in oils as usual.\nBut the summer landscape gradually turned into an autumn one cause I fell a bit behind the season change 🐌",
    "sources": [
      {
        "label": "DeviantArt",
        "url": "https://www.deviantart.com/alinaivy/art/Meeting-1266029830"
      }
    ]
